<div class="about-page">
	<header class="about-header">
		<a href={resolve('/')}>← SID MENON</a>
	</header>

	<main>
		<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
			<h1 id="about-heading">About</h1>
			<div class="bio">
				<p>My name is Sidharth (Sid) Menon.</p>
				<p>I am currently based out of San Francisco and am interested in the intersection of technology, design, and culture.</p>
				<p>I grew up in Ohio and studied computer science at Harvard. Before SF, I lived in NYC for three years.</p>
				<p>Currently, I'm the co-founder of <a href="https://dev.fast">/dev/fast (YC W26)</a>, a next-generation, AI-native code forge.</p>
				<p>In my free time, I like to travel, cook, read, and play tennis. In 2026, I'm exploring some new hobbies (dance, improv, learning Malayalam and Spanish) and looking forward to meeting some great folks in SF!</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="collection books" aria-labelledby="books-heading">
			<h2 id="books-heading">BOOKS</h2>
			<p class="section-intro">I read a lot and do a pretty poor job of updating this site when I finish something. Here's essentially a random sample of books I've read in the last twelve months that I've really enjoyed:</p>

			<div class="book-list">
				{#each data.books as book (book.title)}
					<div class="book-row">
						<div class="book-title-line">
							<span class="book-title">{book.title}</span>
							<span class="mobile-year">{book.originalPublicationYear ?? '—'}</span>
						</div>
						<span class="leader" aria-hidden="true"></span>
						<span class="author">{book.author}</span>
						<span class="book-year">{book.originalPublicationYear ?? '—'}</span>
					</div>
				{/each}
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="collection blogs" aria-labelledby="blogs-heading">
